      {
        "id": "major-question-01",
        "label": "問題1〜3",
        "order": 1,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><h2>問題1〜3 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>1</dt><dd>イ</dd></div><div><dt>2</dt><dd>オ</dd></div><div><dt>3</dt><dd>エ</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈電気振動〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">1．コンデンサーの電圧が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"E\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となるので、静電エネルギーの公式より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-918ed5b0afe5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈電気振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12CE^2=\\frac{CE^2}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">2．エネルギー保存則より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-918ed5b0afe5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈電気振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12CE^2=\\frac12C\\left(\\frac12E\\right)^2+\\frac12LI_\\tau^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-918ed5b0afe5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈電気振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\quad I_\\tau=\\sqrt{\\frac{3CE^2}{4L}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-918ed5b0afe5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈電気振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12CE^2=\\frac12LI_{\\max}^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-918ed5b0afe5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈電気振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\quad I_{\\max}=\\sqrt{\\frac{CE^2}{L}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-918ed5b0afe5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈電気振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\quad \\frac{I_\\tau}{I_{\\max}}=\\sqrt{\\frac34}=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">3．電気量が半分になるとき、電圧も半分になる。この電気振動の角振動数は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"1/\\sqrt{LC}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> であり、電圧の最大値はスイッチ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"S_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を閉じたときの <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"E\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> であるから</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-918ed5b0afe5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈電気振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12E=E\\cos\\frac{\\tau}{\\sqrt{LC}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-918ed5b0afe5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈電気振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{\\tau}{\\sqrt{LC}}=\\frac\\pi3\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-918ed5b0afe5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈電気振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\quad \\tau=\\frac{\\pi\\sqrt{LC}}3\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "問題4",
        "order": 2,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><h2>問題4 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈磁場内での荷電粒子の運動〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">粒子の円運動の半径を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"r\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおき、円運動の運動方程式をたてると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-204a8e5a2086\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈磁場内での荷電粒子の運動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"m\\frac{v^2}{r}=qvB\\quad\\therefore\\quad r=\\frac{mv}{qB}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">求める時間は周期の半分となるので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-204a8e5a2086\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈磁場内での荷電粒子の運動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{2\\pi r}{v}\\times\\frac12=\\frac{\\pi m}{qB}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-03",
        "label": "問題5",
        "order": 3,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-03\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-03\"><h2>問題5 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈ファラデーの法則〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">磁束密度の変化の大きさを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\Delta B\\,[\\mathrm{T}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおき、ファラデーの法則を用いると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-afa0fcd4a587\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈ファラデーの法則〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"2.0=100\\times\\frac{\\Delta B\\times4.0\\times10^{-3}}{0.10}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-afa0fcd4a587\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈ファラデーの法則〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\quad \\Delta B=0.50\\,[\\mathrm{T}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-04",
        "label": "問題6",
        "order": 4,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-04\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-04\"><h2>問題6 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈金属小球の接触と静電気力〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">小球AとBに与えた負の電気量を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-q\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、静電気力の比例定数を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"k\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P_A\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> と <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P_B\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の距離を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"r\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1d0efede4476\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈金属小球の接触と静電気力〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"F=k\\frac{q^2}{r^2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">接触後のAとCの電気量は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-q\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の半分になる。CがAから受ける力を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"F_A\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、Bから受ける力を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"F_B\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1d0efede4476\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈金属小球の接触と静電気力〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"F_A=k\\frac{(\\frac12q)^2}{(\\frac12r)^2}=k\\frac{q^2}{r^2}=F\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">向きはCから <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P_B\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> に向かう方向である。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1d0efede4476\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈金属小球の接触と静電気力〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"F_B=k\\frac{\\frac12q^2}{(\\frac12r)^2}=k\\frac{2q^2}{r^2}=2F\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">向きはCから <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P_A\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> に向かう方向である。</p><p class=\"prose\">よって、Cが受ける力は次ページのとおりである。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-1d0efede4476\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈金属小球の接触と静電気力〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"F_B-F_A=2F-F=F\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">したがって、合力の向きはCから <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P_A\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> に向かう方向である。</p></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-05",
        "label": "問題7・8",
        "order": 5,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-05\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-05\"><h2>問題7・8 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>7</dt><dd>ウ</dd></div><div><dt>8</dt><dd>エ</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈結合エネルギー〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">7．<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}^{2}_{1}\\mathrm{H}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は陽子と中性子の2個の核子で構成されているので、反応前の全結合エネルギーは</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-363c3ac2dffb\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈結合エネルギー〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"1.11\\times2\\times2=4.44\\,[\\mathrm{MeV}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">放出されたエネルギーが3.27 MeVであることより、反応後の全結合エネルギーは</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-363c3ac2dffb\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈結合エネルギー〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"4.44+3.27=7.71\\,[\\mathrm{MeV}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}^{3}_{2}\\mathrm{He}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は核子が3個であるから、1個当たりの結合エネルギーは</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-363c3ac2dffb\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈結合エネルギー〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{7.71}{3}=2.57\\,[\\mathrm{MeV}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">8．質量欠損を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m\\,[\\mathrm{kg}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-363c3ac2dffb\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈結合エネルギー〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"7.71\\times1.60\\times10^{-13}=m\\times(3.00\\times10^8)^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-363c3ac2dffb\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈結合エネルギー〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\quad m=1.37\\times10^{-29}\\,[\\mathrm{kg}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-06",
        "label": "問題9",
        "order": 6,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-06\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-06\"><h2>問題9 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈ラジウムのα崩壊〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">求めるラジウムの質量を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m\\,[\\mathrm{mg}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおき、半減期の式を用いると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-b203a0042a74\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈ラジウムのα崩壊〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"m=24\\times\\left(\\frac12\\right)^{33/11}=3.0\\,[\\mathrm{mg}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-07",
        "label": "問題10",
        "order": 7,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-07\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-07\"><h2>問題10 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈波の干渉〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">ウは誤文。山と山が重なってできる大きな山は腹線上を移動する。</p></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-08",
        "label": "問題11",
        "order": 8,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-08\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-08\"><h2>問題11 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈開管の共鳴〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">共鳴するときの開管の長さの差は波長の半分となるので、波長を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\lambda\\,[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cd72c2670dbb\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈開管の共鳴〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\lambda=2(40-30)\\times10^{-2}=0.20\\,[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">波の基本式より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cd72c2670dbb\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈開管の共鳴〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"340=f_0\\times0.20\\quad\\therefore\\quad f_0=1700\\,[\\mathrm{Hz}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-09",
        "label": "問題12",
        "order": 9,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-09\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-09\"><h2>問題12 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈うなり〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">うなりの振動数を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f\\,[\\mathrm{Hz}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-92269b391635\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈うなり〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"f=\\frac{20}{5}=4\\,[\\mathrm{Hz}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">よって、おんさAの振動数は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"470\\pm4\\,[\\mathrm{Hz}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となる。おんさBの振動数を小さくするとうなりの振動数が大きくなるので、おんさAの振動数はおんさBの振動数より大きい <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"470+4=474\\,[\\mathrm{Hz}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となる。</p></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-10",
        "label": "問題13",
        "order": 10,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-10\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-10\"><h2>問題13 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈全反射〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">光が油から空気へ出るときの臨界角を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\theta_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと、屈折の法則より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-b1d98acd9400\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈全反射〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt2\\sin\\theta_0=\\sin90^\\circ\\quad\\therefore\\quad\\theta_0=45^\\circ\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">入射角が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\theta_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となるときの <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"r\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を求めればよいので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-b1d98acd9400\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈全反射〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\tan45^\\circ=\\frac rD\\quad\\therefore\\quad r=D\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-11",
        "label": "問題14",
        "order": 11,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-11\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-11\"><h2>問題14 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈凸レンズと凹レンズ〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">Aによる像の位置をAから右へ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"b\\,[\\mathrm{cm}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと、レンズの式より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-acb482eb689b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈凸レンズと凹レンズ〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac1{60}+\\frac1b=\\frac1{20}\\quad\\therefore\\quad b=30\\,[\\mathrm{cm}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">よって、Aによる像の位置はBから右へ5 cmのところであり、Bによる像の位置をBから右へ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"b&#39;\\,[\\mathrm{cm}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと、レンズの式より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-acb482eb689b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈凸レンズと凹レンズ〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac1{-5}+\\frac1{b&#39;}=-\\frac1{10}\\quad\\therefore\\quad b&#39;=10\\,[\\mathrm{cm}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">以上から、物体からの距離は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"60+25+10=95\\,[\\mathrm{cm}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>。</p></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-12",
        "label": "問題15",
        "order": 12,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-12\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-12\"><h2>問題15 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈熱効率〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">A→Bは定積変化であり、気体が吸収した熱量を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"Q_{AB}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、気体が外部にした仕事を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"W_{AB}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-f565759e0db4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈熱効率〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"Q_{AB}=\\frac32(3pV-pV)=3pV,\\qquad W_{AB}=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">B→Cは等温変化であり、気体が吸収した熱量を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"Q_{BC}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、気体が外部にした仕事を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"W_{BC}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-f565759e0db4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈熱効率〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"Q_{BC}=Q,\\qquad W_{BC}=Q\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">C→Aは定圧変化であり、気体が吸収した熱量を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"Q_{CA}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、気体が外部にした仕事を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"W_{CA}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-f565759e0db4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈熱効率〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"Q_{CA}=\\frac52(pV-3pV)=-5pV,\\qquad W_{CA}=-2pV\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">よって、熱効率 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"e\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-f565759e0db4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈熱効率〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"e=\\frac{Q-2pV}{Q+3pV}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-13",
        "label": "問題16・17",
        "order": 13,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-13\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-13\"><h2>問題16・17 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>16</dt><dd>イ</dd></div><div><dt>17</dt><dd>ア</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈熱量と比熱、熱容量〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">16．容器の熱容量を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"C\\,[\\mathrm{J/K}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと、1回目の混合における熱量の保存より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-f00167b6c682\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈熱量と比熱、熱容量〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"100\\times4.2\\times(24-10)+C\\times(24-10)=50\\times4.2\\times(70-24)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-f00167b6c682\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈熱量と比熱、熱容量〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\quad C=270\\,[\\mathrm{J/K}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">17．全体の温度を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t\\,[^\\circ\\mathrm{C}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと、2回目の混合における熱量の保存より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-f00167b6c682\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈熱量と比熱、熱容量〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"150\\times4.2\\times(t-24)+270\\times(t-24)=300\\times0.45\\times(70-t)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-f00167b6c682\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈熱量と比熱、熱容量〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\quad t=30\\,[^\\circ\\mathrm{C}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-14",
        "label": "問題18",
        "order": 14,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-14\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-14\"><h2>問題18 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈棒の質量〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">棒の質量を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m\\,[\\mathrm{kg}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおき、鉛直方向の力のつりあいを考えると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-d506ac5a3a48\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈棒の質量〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"m\\times9.8=40+9.0\\quad\\therefore\\quad m=\\frac{49}{9.8}=5.0\\,[\\mathrm{kg}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-15",
        "label": "問題19",
        "order": 15,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-15\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-15\"><h2>問題19 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈地球と月の半径の比〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">物体と地球の質量をそれぞれ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m,M\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、万有引力定数を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"G\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、地球の半径を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、地球表面の重力加速度を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"g\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、地球の脱出速度を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。力学的エネルギー保存則より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c5177c4255d3\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈地球と月の半径の比〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12mv_0^2-G\\frac{Mm}{R}=0\\quad\\therefore\\quad v_0=\\sqrt{\\frac{2GM}{R}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">ここで、地球表面上に静止する物体にはたらく重力と万有引力の関係から</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c5177c4255d3\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈地球と月の半径の比〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"mg=G\\frac{Mm}{R^2},\\qquad GM=gR^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">が成り立つので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c5177c4255d3\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈地球と月の半径の比〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_0=\\sqrt{\\frac{2gR^2}{R}}=\\sqrt{2gR}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">月面の重力加速度を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"g&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、月の脱出速度を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_0&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、月の半径を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと、地球の場合と同様にして</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c5177c4255d3\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈地球と月の半径の比〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_0&#39;=\\sqrt{2g&#39;R&#39;}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c5177c4255d3\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈地球と月の半径の比〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{v_0}{v_0&#39;}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2gR}}{\\sqrt{2g&#39;R&#39;}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c5177c4255d3\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈地球と月の半径の比〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{4.7v_0&#39;}{v_0&#39;}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2\\times6.0g&#39;\\times R}}{\\sqrt{2g&#39;R&#39;}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c5177c4255d3\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈地球と月の半径の比〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\quad \\frac{R}{R&#39;}=\\frac{4.7^2}{6.0}=3.68\\simeq3.7\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-16",
        "label": "問題20〜25",
        "order": 16,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-16\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-16\"><h2>問題20〜25 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>20</dt><dd>エ</dd></div><div><dt>21</dt><dd>イ</dd></div><div><dt>22</dt><dd>オ</dd></div><div><dt>23</dt><dd>ウ</dd></div><div><dt>24</dt><dd>ウ</dd></div><div><dt>25</dt><dd>ア</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説〈あらい水平面上での単振動〉</h3><p class=\"prose\">20．ばねのばね定数を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"k\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおき、小球Bを鉛直に吊るしたときの力のつりあいの式をたてると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a6801b25ee5b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈あらい水平面上での単振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"ka=mg\\quad\\therefore\\quad k=\\frac{mg}{a}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">小球Bが点Pにあるときのばねのエネルギーが、小球Bが点Oまで移動する間に動摩擦力のした仕事より大きければよいので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a6801b25ee5b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈あらい水平面上での単振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12kp^2&gt;\\mu&#39;mgp\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a6801b25ee5b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈あらい水平面上での単振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12\\frac{mg}{a}p^2&gt;\\mu&#39;mgp\\quad\\therefore\\quad p&gt;2a\\mu&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">21．点Qですべる条件は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a6801b25ee5b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈あらい水平面上での単振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"kq&gt;\\mu mg\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a6801b25ee5b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈あらい水平面上での単振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{mg}{a}q&gt;\\mu mg\\quad\\therefore\\quad\\mu&lt;\\frac qa\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">22．エネルギーと仕事の関係より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a6801b25ee5b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈あらい水平面上での単振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12kp^2=\\frac12kq^2+\\mu&#39;mg(p+q)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a6801b25ee5b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈あらい水平面上での単振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12\\frac{mg}{a}p^2=\\frac12\\frac{mg}{a}q^2+\\mu&#39;mg(p+q)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a6801b25ee5b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈あらい水平面上での単振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"(p^2-q^2)=2\\mu&#39;a(p+q)\\quad\\therefore\\quad\\mu&#39;=\\frac{p-q}{2a}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">23．単振動の中心で速さが最大となるので、点O&#39;はPQの中点であり</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a6801b25ee5b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈あらい水平面上での単振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"PO&#39;=\\frac{p+q}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">24．単振動の振幅が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"PO&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> なので、速さの最大値の式より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a6801b25ee5b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈あらい水平面上での単振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{p+q}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{m}}=\\frac{p+q}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac1m\\frac{mg}{a}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a6801b25ee5b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈あらい水平面上での単振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"=\\frac{p+q}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac ga}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">25．求める時間は周期の半分となるので、周期の式より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a6801b25ee5b\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">解説〈あらい水平面上での単振動〉</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac mk}\\times\\frac12=\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{ma}{mg}}=\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac ag}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">例年通り25問で構成されているが、2025年度は1〜3、7・8、16・17、20〜25のそれぞれが1つの大問となっていた。全体的に難度が高い問題はないが、1科目あたり40分程度の試験時間なので、解答にはスピードが要求される。</p><p class=\"prose\">1〜3の電気振動では電圧を求めるのに三角関数を用いることに気づく必要があり、6の金属小球の接触と静電気力や19の地球と月の半径の比では種々の物理量を自分で定義して考える必要があるので、問題文を正しく理解していないと厳しい。7・8の結合エネルギー、13の全反射は知識があれば簡単に解ける。14の凸レンズと凹レンズは凹レンズの扱い方に注意が必要である。15の熱効率、16・17の熱量と比熱、熱容量は内容をしっかり読み取れれば解ける。20〜25のあらい水平面上での単振動は苦手とする受験生も多いが、振動の中心で速さが最大であることや速さ0が端になるなどの知識や公式を上手に活用すれば解ける。</p><p class=\"prose\">日頃の学習の成果が点数に反映される問題なので、十分な準備を重ね、高得点を目指してほしい。</p></section></div></article>"
      }
    ]
  },
